{
 "AOTRCampaign_00": [
  {
   "start": 4.91,
   "end": 8.19,
   "text": "It began with the forging\nof the Great Rings.",
   "start_frame": 117,
   "end_frame": 196
  },
  {
   "start": 8.92,
   "end": 14.7,
   "text": "Three were given to the Elves, immortal,\nwisest, and fairest of all beings.",
   "start_frame": 214,
   "end_frame": 352
  },
  {
   "start": 16.44,
   "end": 22.55,
   "text": "Seven to the Dwarf Lords, great miners\nand craftsmen of the mountain halls.",
   "start_frame": 394,
   "end_frame": 541
  },
  {
   "start": 23.88,
   "end": 30.29,
   "text": "And nine, nine rings were gifted to\nthe race of men who, above all else,",
   "start_frame": 573,
   "end_frame": 726
  },
  {
   "start": 30.34,
   "end": 31.86,
   "text": "desire power.",
   "start_frame": 728,
   "end_frame": 764
  },
  {
   "start": 33.79,
   "end": 38.45,
   "text": "For within these rings was bound the\nstrength and will to govern each race.",
   "start_frame": 810,
   "end_frame": 922
  },
  {
   "start": 40.48,
   "end": 42.98,
   "text": "But they were all of them deceived,",
   "start_frame": 971,
   "end_frame": 1031
  },
  {
   "start": 43.64,
   "end": 46.04,
   "text": "for another ring was made.",
   "start_frame": 1047,
   "end_frame": 1104
  },
  {
   "start": 46.58,
   "end": 52.63,
   "text": "In the land of Mordor, in the fires\nof Mount Doom, the Dark Lord Sauron",
   "start_frame": 1117,
   "end_frame": 1263
  },
  {
   "start": 52.68,
   "end": 57.46,
   "text": "forged in secret a master\nring to control all others.",
   "start_frame": 1264,
   "end_frame": 1379
  },
  {
   "start": 57.8,
   "end": 64.07000000000001,
   "text": "And into this ring he poured his cruelty,\nhis malice, and his will to dominate all",
   "start_frame": 1387,
   "end_frame": 1537
  },
  {
   "start": 64.12,
   "end": 64.92,
   "text": "life.",
   "start_frame": 1538,
   "end_frame": 1558
  },
  {
   "start": 67.03,
   "end": 71.47,
   "text": "One ring to rule them all, one",
   "start_frame": 1608,
   "end_frame": 1715
  },
  {
   "start": 72.23,
   "end": 73.39,
   "text": "by one.",
   "start_frame": 1733,
   "end_frame": 1761
  },
  {
   "start": 74.13,
   "end": 78.29,
   "text": "Three lands of Middle-earth fell\nto the power of the Ring, but",
   "start_frame": 1779,
   "end_frame": 1878
  },
  {
   "start": 78.82,
   "end": 81.36,
   "text": "there were some who resisted.",
   "start_frame": 1891,
   "end_frame": 1952
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_01": [
  {
   "start": 3.89,
   "end": 9.03,
   "text": "Sauron, the enemy of the free peoples\nof Middle-earth, was defeated.",
   "start_frame": 93,
   "end_frame": 216
  },
  {
   "start": 11.58,
   "end": 17.77,
   "text": "But the hearts of men are easily\ncorrupted, and the Ring of Power",
   "start_frame": 277,
   "end_frame": 426
  },
  {
   "start": 17.82,
   "end": 20.14,
   "text": "has a will of its own.",
   "start_frame": 427,
   "end_frame": 483
  },
  {
   "start": 23.88,
   "end": 30.18,
   "text": "History became legend, legend\nbecame myth, and for two and a half",
   "start_frame": 573,
   "end_frame": 724
  },
  {
   "start": 30.23,
   "end": 33.980000000000004,
   "text": "thousand years the Ring\npassed out of all knowledge.",
   "start_frame": 725,
   "end_frame": 815
  },
  {
   "start": 34.03,
   "end": 35.39,
   "text": "When",
   "start_frame": 816,
   "end_frame": 849
  },
  {
   "start": 37.39,
   "end": 41.78,
   "text": "chance came, it ensnared a new bearer.",
   "start_frame": 897,
   "end_frame": 1002
  },
  {
   "start": 48.87,
   "end": 54.660000000000004,
   "text": "The ring came to the creature Gollum,\nwho took it deep into the tunnels of the Misty",
   "start_frame": 1172,
   "end_frame": 1311
  },
  {
   "start": 54.71,
   "end": 55.23,
   "text": "Mountains.",
   "start_frame": 1313,
   "end_frame": 1325
  },
  {
   "start": 57.56,
   "end": 61.32,
   "text": "But something happened then\nthe ring did not intend.",
   "start_frame": 1381,
   "end_frame": 1471
  },
  {
   "start": 61.54,
   "end": 62.02,
   "text": "Day",
   "start_frame": 1476,
   "end_frame": 1488
  },
  {
   "start": 67.61,
   "end": 68.93,
   "text": "of September in",
   "start_frame": 1622,
   "end_frame": 1654
  },
  {
   "start": 69.68,
   "end": 71.1,
   "text": "the year 1400.",
   "start_frame": 1672,
   "end_frame": 1706
  },
  {
   "start": 72.47,
   "end": 74.47,
   "text": "By Shire Reckoning.",
   "start_frame": 1739,
   "end_frame": 1787
  },
  {
   "start": 75.22,
   "end": 78.82000000000001,
   "text": "Bag End. Bagshot Row. Hobbiton.",
   "start_frame": 1805,
   "end_frame": 1891
  },
  {
   "start": 78.87,
   "end": 80.41,
   "text": "West Farthing.",
   "start_frame": 1892,
   "end_frame": 1929
  },
  {
   "start": 81.34,
   "end": 82.36,
   "text": "The Shire.",
   "start_frame": 1952,
   "end_frame": 1976
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_01a": [
  {
   "start": 4.27,
   "end": 6.97,
   "text": "Concerning hobbits.",
   "start_frame": 102,
   "end_frame": 167
  },
  {
   "start": 9.9,
   "end": 14.37,
   "text": "Hobbits have been living and farming in\nthe forefarlings of the Shire for many",
   "start_frame": 237,
   "end_frame": 344
  },
  {
   "start": 14.42,
   "end": 20.61,
   "text": "hundreds of years. Quite content to ignore\nand be ignored by the world of the big",
   "start_frame": 346,
   "end_frame": 494
  },
  {
   "start": 20.66,
   "end": 21.34,
   "text": "folk.",
   "start_frame": 495,
   "end_frame": 512
  },
  {
   "start": 22.8,
   "end": 28.7,
   "text": "In fact, it has been remarked by some that\nhobbits' only real passion is for food.",
   "start_frame": 547,
   "end_frame": 688
  },
  {
   "start": 30.25,
   "end": 35.38,
   "text": "A rather unfair observation, as we have\nalso developed a keen interest in the",
   "start_frame": 726,
   "end_frame": 849
  },
  {
   "start": 35.43,
   "end": 39.57,
   "text": "brewing of ales And the\nsmoking of pipe weed But",
   "start_frame": 850,
   "end_frame": 949
  },
  {
   "start": 40.13,
   "end": 44.63,
   "text": "where our hearts truly lie Is in peace And",
   "start_frame": 963,
   "end_frame": 1071
  },
  {
   "start": 45.71,
   "end": 47.11,
   "text": "good till",
   "start_frame": 1097,
   "end_frame": 1130
  },
  {
   "start": 48.02,
   "end": 52.88,
   "text": "For all hobbits share a\nlove Of things that grow And",
   "start_frame": 1152,
   "end_frame": 1269
  },
  {
   "start": 56.78,
   "end": 63.06,
   "text": "yes, no doubt to others Our ways\nseem quaint But today of all days",
   "start_frame": 1362,
   "end_frame": 1513
  },
  {
   "start": 63.11,
   "end": 67.04,
   "text": "It is brought home to me No",
   "start_frame": 1514,
   "end_frame": 1608
  },
  {
   "start": 67.64,
   "end": 71.84,
   "text": "bad thing To celebrate A simple life",
   "start_frame": 1623,
   "end_frame": 1724
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_01b": [
  {
   "start": 0.27,
   "end": 5.84,
   "text": "Gandalf, my old friend, this\nwill be a night to remember.",
   "start_frame": 6,
   "end_frame": 140
  },
  {
   "start": 25.74,
   "end": 29.91,
   "text": "Eleventy-one years is far too short a\ntime to live among such excellent and",
   "start_frame": 617,
   "end_frame": 717
  },
  {
   "start": 29.96,
   "end": 31.42,
   "text": "admirable hobbits.",
   "start_frame": 719,
   "end_frame": 754
  },
  {
   "start": 32.62,
   "end": 37.21,
   "text": "I don't know half of you half as well as I\nshould like, and I like less than half of",
   "start_frame": 782,
   "end_frame": 893
  },
  {
   "start": 37.26,
   "end": 38.76,
   "text": "you half as well as you deserve.",
   "start_frame": 894,
   "end_frame": 930
  },
  {
   "start": 38.88,
   "end": 39.62,
   "text": "I",
   "start_frame": 933,
   "end_frame": 950
  },
  {
   "start": 43.96,
   "end": 45.68,
   "text": "regret",
   "start_frame": 1055,
   "end_frame": 1096
  },
  {
   "start": 49.67,
   "end": 51.95,
   "text": "to announce this is the end.",
   "start_frame": 1192,
   "end_frame": 1246
  },
  {
   "start": 54.21,
   "end": 58.66,
   "text": "I'm going now. I bid you\nall a very fond farewell.",
   "start_frame": 1301,
   "end_frame": 1407
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_02": [
  {
   "start": 0.27,
   "end": 0.81,
   "text": "Bilbo!",
   "start_frame": 6,
   "end_frame": 19
  },
  {
   "start": 1.4,
   "end": 2.38,
   "text": "Bilbo!",
   "start_frame": 33,
   "end_frame": 57
  },
  {
   "start": 11.99,
   "end": 18.419999999999998,
   "text": "This is the One Ring, forged by\nthe Dark Lord Sauron in the fires",
   "start_frame": 287,
   "end_frame": 442
  },
  {
   "start": 18.47,
   "end": 23.38,
   "text": "of Mount Doom, taken by Isildur\nfrom the hand of Sauron himself.",
   "start_frame": 443,
   "end_frame": 561
  },
  {
   "start": 24.74,
   "end": 26.86,
   "text": "Bilbo found it in",
   "start_frame": 593,
   "end_frame": 644
  },
  {
   "start": 28.13,
   "end": 33.82,
   "text": "Gollum's cave. For sixty years,\nthe Ring lay quiet in Bilbo's,",
   "start_frame": 675,
   "end_frame": 811
  },
  {
   "start": 34.42,
   "end": 37.66,
   "text": "prolonging his life, delaying old age.",
   "start_frame": 826,
   "end_frame": 903
  },
  {
   "start": 38.76,
   "end": 42.81,
   "text": "But no longer, Frodo.\nEvil is stirring in Mordor.",
   "start_frame": 930,
   "end_frame": 1027
  },
  {
   "start": 42.86,
   "end": 45.04,
   "text": "The ring has awoken.",
   "start_frame": 1028,
   "end_frame": 1080
  },
  {
   "start": 45.72,
   "end": 48.52,
   "text": "It's heard its master's call.",
   "start_frame": 1097,
   "end_frame": 1164
  },
  {
   "start": 48.64,
   "end": 50.22,
   "text": "But he was destroyed.",
   "start_frame": 1167,
   "end_frame": 1205
  },
  {
   "start": 51.17,
   "end": 53.53,
   "text": "Sauron was destroyed. The",
   "start_frame": 1228,
   "end_frame": 1284
  },
  {
   "start": 61.87,
   "end": 64.27,
   "text": "spirit of Sauron endured.",
   "start_frame": 1484,
   "end_frame": 1542
  },
  {
   "start": 65.17,
   "end": 68.67,
   "text": "Frodo, he must never find it.",
   "start_frame": 1564,
   "end_frame": 1648
  },
  {
   "start": 71.26,
   "end": 72.26,
   "text": "What must I do?",
   "start_frame": 1710,
   "end_frame": 1734
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_03_a": [
  {
   "start": 4.14,
   "end": 8.2,
   "text": "Where am I? You are in the house of Elrond.",
   "start_frame": 99,
   "end_frame": 196
  },
  {
   "start": 9.67,
   "end": 11.95,
   "text": "And it is ten o'clock in the morning.",
   "start_frame": 232,
   "end_frame": 286
  },
  {
   "start": 12.19,
   "end": 15.11,
   "text": "On October the 24th, if you want to know.",
   "start_frame": 292,
   "end_frame": 362
  },
  {
   "start": 18.46,
   "end": 21.68,
   "text": "Gandalf! Yes, I'm here. And",
   "start_frame": 443,
   "end_frame": 520
  },
  {
   "start": 24.04,
   "end": 26.06,
   "text": "you're lucky to be here, too.",
   "start_frame": 576,
   "end_frame": 625
  },
  {
   "start": 26.2,
   "end": 26.98,
   "text": "A",
   "start_frame": 628,
   "end_frame": 647
  },
  {
   "start": 27.67,
   "end": 30.81,
   "text": "few more hours and you would\nhave been beyond our aid.",
   "start_frame": 664,
   "end_frame": 739
  },
  {
   "start": 30.89,
   "end": 31.67,
   "text": "What",
   "start_frame": 741,
   "end_frame": 760
  },
  {
   "start": 35.56,
   "end": 36.8,
   "text": "happened, Gandalf?",
   "start_frame": 853,
   "end_frame": 883
  },
  {
   "start": 38.6,
   "end": 40.2,
   "text": "Why didn't you meet us?",
   "start_frame": 926,
   "end_frame": 964
  },
  {
   "start": 40.8,
   "end": 42.74,
   "text": "Oh, I am sorry, Frodo.",
   "start_frame": 979,
   "end_frame": 1025
  },
  {
   "start": 48.68,
   "end": 50.0,
   "text": "I was delayed.",
   "start_frame": 1168,
   "end_frame": 1200
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_03_b": [
  {
   "start": 0.05,
   "end": 0.75,
   "text": "Frodo!",
   "start_frame": 1,
   "end_frame": 18
  },
  {
   "start": 2.4,
   "end": 5.22,
   "text": "Frodo! Sam! Bless you, you're awake!",
   "start_frame": 57,
   "end_frame": 125
  },
  {
   "start": 5.64,
   "end": 8.16,
   "text": "Sam has hardly left your side.",
   "start_frame": 135,
   "end_frame": 195
  },
  {
   "start": 8.3,
   "end": 10.78,
   "text": "We were that worried\nabout you, weren't we, Mr.",
   "start_frame": 199,
   "end_frame": 258
  },
  {
   "start": 10.83,
   "end": 15.21,
   "text": "Gandalf? By the skills of Lord\nElrond, you're beginning to mend.",
   "start_frame": 259,
   "end_frame": 365
  },
  {
   "start": 17.92,
   "end": 21.29,
   "text": "Welcome to Rivendell, Frodo Baggins.",
   "start_frame": 430,
   "end_frame": 510
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_03_c": [
  {
   "start": 0.46,
   "end": 6.19,
   "text": "Strangers from distant lands, friends of\nold, you've been summoned here to answer",
   "start_frame": 11,
   "end_frame": 148
  },
  {
   "start": 6.24,
   "end": 12.04,
   "text": "the threat of Mordor. Middle-earth\nstands upon the brink of destruction.",
   "start_frame": 149,
   "end_frame": 288
  },
  {
   "start": 12.2,
   "end": 16.73,
   "text": "None can escape it. You will\nunite, or you will fail.",
   "start_frame": 292,
   "end_frame": 401
  },
  {
   "start": 18.62,
   "end": 21.81,
   "text": "The Ring was made in\nthe fires of Mount Doom.",
   "start_frame": 446,
   "end_frame": 523
  },
  {
   "start": 21.86,
   "end": 22.48,
   "text": "Only",
   "start_frame": 524,
   "end_frame": 539
  },
  {
   "start": 23.5,
   "end": 24.84,
   "text": "there can it",
   "start_frame": 564,
   "end_frame": 596
  },
  {
   "start": 28.5,
   "end": 34.38,
   "text": "be taken deep into Mordor and cast back\ninto the fiery chasm from whence it came.",
   "start_frame": 684,
   "end_frame": 825
  },
  {
   "start": 37.42,
   "end": 38.46,
   "text": "One of you.",
   "start_frame": 898,
   "end_frame": 923
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_05": [
  {
   "start": 10.26,
   "end": 11.14,
   "text": "Jirisk,",
   "start_frame": 246,
   "end_frame": 267
  },
  {
   "start": 22.61,
   "end": 25.31,
   "text": "Dwarf city of Dwarodath.",
   "start_frame": 542,
   "end_frame": 607
  },
  {
   "start": 28.88,
   "end": 30.96,
   "text": "There's an eye-opener and no mistake.",
   "start_frame": 693,
   "end_frame": 743
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_06": [],
 "AOTRCampaign_07": [
  {
   "start": 9.23,
   "end": 10.92,
   "text": "Where are you taking us? Into the wild.",
   "start_frame": 221,
   "end_frame": 262
  },
  {
   "start": 10.97,
   "end": 11.79,
   "text": "I think",
   "start_frame": 263,
   "end_frame": 282
  },
  {
   "start": 24.45,
   "end": 28.47,
   "text": "a servant of the enemy would\nlook fairer and feel fouler.",
   "start_frame": 586,
   "end_frame": 683
  },
  {
   "start": 28.52,
   "end": 30.64,
   "text": "He's foul enough. We",
   "start_frame": 684,
   "end_frame": 735
  },
  {
   "start": 32.0,
   "end": 33.730000000000004,
   "text": "have no choice but to trust him.",
   "start_frame": 768,
   "end_frame": 809
  },
  {
   "start": 33.78,
   "end": 36.26,
   "text": "But where is he leading us?",
   "start_frame": 810,
   "end_frame": 870
  },
  {
   "start": 36.86,
   "end": 39.36,
   "text": "Rivendell, Master Gamgee. To",
   "start_frame": 884,
   "end_frame": 944
  },
  {
   "start": 40.56,
   "end": 43.04,
   "text": "the House of Elrond. Did you hear that?",
   "start_frame": 973,
   "end_frame": 1032
  },
  {
   "start": 43.14,
   "end": 45.89,
   "text": "Rivendell. We're going to see the elves.",
   "start_frame": 1035,
   "end_frame": 1101
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_08": [],
 "AOTRCampaign_09": [],
 "AOTRCampaign_10": [
  {
   "start": 14.16,
   "end": 16.58,
   "text": "What have I desired of the kings of old?",
   "start_frame": 339,
   "end_frame": 397
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaign_Credits": [
  {
   "start": 1.01,
   "end": 1.81,
   "text": "I hope",
   "start_frame": 24,
   "end_frame": 43
  },
  {
   "start": 18.89,
   "end": 20.45,
   "text": "the others find a safer route.",
   "start_frame": 453,
   "end_frame": 490
  },
  {
   "start": 22.86,
   "end": 23.81,
   "text": "Strider will look after them.",
   "start_frame": 548,
   "end_frame": 571
  },
  {
   "start": 23.86,
   "end": 24.26,
   "text": "I",
   "start_frame": 572,
   "end_frame": 582
  },
  {
   "start": 26.56,
   "end": 28.24,
   "text": "don't suppose we'll ever see them again.",
   "start_frame": 637,
   "end_frame": 677
  },
  {
   "start": 30.44,
   "end": 32.1,
   "text": "Mr. Frodo, we",
   "start_frame": 730,
   "end_frame": 770
  },
  {
   "start": 32.63,
   "end": 33.13,
   "text": "may.",
   "start_frame": 783,
   "end_frame": 795
  },
  {
   "start": 40.72,
   "end": 42.16,
   "text": "I'm glad you're with me.",
   "start_frame": 977,
   "end_frame": 1011
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_00": [
  {
   "start": 28.72,
   "end": 33.9,
   "text": "Sauron will use his puppet Saruman\nto destroy the people of Rohan.",
   "start_frame": 689,
   "end_frame": 813
  },
  {
   "start": 37.18,
   "end": 38.88,
   "text": "Isengard, the",
   "start_frame": 892,
   "end_frame": 933
  },
  {
   "start": 45.26,
   "end": 51.5,
   "text": "Eye of Sauron, now turns to Gondor,\nthe last free kingdom of",
   "start_frame": 1086,
   "end_frame": 1236
  },
  {
   "start": 51.55,
   "end": 52.07,
   "text": "men.",
   "start_frame": 1237,
   "end_frame": 1249
  },
  {
   "start": 52.66,
   "end": 56.36,
   "text": "His war on this country\nwill come swiftly, says",
   "start_frame": 1263,
   "end_frame": 1352
  },
  {
   "start": 61.63,
   "end": 63.17,
   "text": "the Ring. The",
   "start_frame": 1479,
   "end_frame": 1516
  },
  {
   "start": 64.34,
   "end": 68.89,
   "text": "strength of the Ring-bearer\nis failing in his heart.",
   "start_frame": 1544,
   "end_frame": 1653
  },
  {
   "start": 68.94,
   "end": 71.34,
   "text": "Frodo begins to understand.",
   "start_frame": 1654,
   "end_frame": 1712
  },
  {
   "start": 71.56,
   "end": 72.3,
   "text": "The",
   "start_frame": 1717,
   "end_frame": 1735
  },
  {
   "start": 73.54,
   "end": 76.10000000000001,
   "text": "quest will claim his life.",
   "start_frame": 1764,
   "end_frame": 1826
  },
  {
   "start": 76.15,
   "end": 76.63,
   "text": "You",
   "start_frame": 1827,
   "end_frame": 1839
  },
  {
   "start": 80.43,
   "end": 82.11,
   "text": "have foreseen it. Bring",
   "start_frame": 1930,
   "end_frame": 1970
  },
  {
   "start": 93.84,
   "end": 97.36,
   "text": "dark. The will of the ring grows strong.",
   "start_frame": 2252,
   "end_frame": 2336
  },
  {
   "start": 103.49,
   "end": 105.01,
   "text": "It's go. For",
   "start_frame": 2483,
   "end_frame": 2520
  },
  {
   "start": 108.32,
   "end": 111.77,
   "text": "Sauron will have dominion\nover all life on this earth.",
   "start_frame": 2599,
   "end_frame": 2682
  },
  {
   "start": 111.82,
   "end": 114.66,
   "text": "Even unto the ending of the time",
   "start_frame": 2683,
   "end_frame": 2751
  },
  {
   "start": 118.3,
   "end": 121.46,
   "text": "of the elves is over. Leave",
   "start_frame": 2839,
   "end_frame": 2915
  },
  {
   "start": 123.4,
   "end": 125.2,
   "text": "Middle-earth to its fate.",
   "start_frame": 2961,
   "end_frame": 3004
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_01": [
  {
   "start": 6.38,
   "end": 11.54,
   "text": "Mordor will pay for this.\nThese orcs are not from Mordor.",
   "start_frame": 153,
   "end_frame": 276
  },
  {
   "start": 11.88,
   "end": 16.27,
   "text": "My lord Éomer! Over here! He's",
   "start_frame": 285,
   "end_frame": 390
  },
  {
   "start": 48.45,
   "end": 49.89,
   "text": "ambushed. If",
   "start_frame": 1162,
   "end_frame": 1197
  },
  {
   "start": 52.22,
   "end": 55.94,
   "text": "we don't defend our country,\nSaruman will take it by force.",
   "start_frame": 1253,
   "end_frame": 1342
  },
  {
   "start": 56.02,
   "end": 58.64,
   "text": "Orcs are roaming freely across our lands.",
   "start_frame": 1344,
   "end_frame": 1407
  },
  {
   "start": 59.28,
   "end": 61.72,
   "text": "Orcs bearing the white hand of Saruman.",
   "start_frame": 1422,
   "end_frame": 1481
  },
  {
   "start": 62.84,
   "end": 64.6,
   "text": "That is a lie.",
   "start_frame": 1508,
   "end_frame": 1550
  },
  {
   "start": 67.85,
   "end": 72.14,
   "text": "Saruman the White has ever\nbeen our friend and ally.",
   "start_frame": 1628,
   "end_frame": 1731
  },
  {
   "start": 72.19,
   "end": 75.49,
   "text": "How long is it since Saruman borned you?",
   "start_frame": 1732,
   "end_frame": 1811
  },
  {
   "start": 76.06,
   "end": 78.34,
   "text": "What was the promised price, screamer?",
   "start_frame": 1825,
   "end_frame": 1880
  },
  {
   "start": 78.58,
   "end": 81.43,
   "text": "When all the men are dead, you will\ntake your share of the treasure?",
   "start_frame": 1885,
   "end_frame": 1954
  },
  {
   "start": 81.48,
   "end": 82.24,
   "text": "Son",
   "start_frame": 1955,
   "end_frame": 1973
  },
  {
   "start": 91.57,
   "end": 93.27,
   "text": "of Aeoman, you",
   "start_frame": 2197,
   "end_frame": 2238
  },
  {
   "start": 97.61,
   "end": 101.82000000000001,
   "text": "are banished forthwith\nfrom the kingdom of Rohan.",
   "start_frame": 2342,
   "end_frame": 2443
  },
  {
   "start": 101.87,
   "end": 103.31,
   "text": "All its domains.",
   "start_frame": 2444,
   "end_frame": 2479
  },
  {
   "start": 104.49,
   "end": 106.71,
   "text": "Under pain of death.",
   "start_frame": 2507,
   "end_frame": 2561
  },
  {
   "start": 107.31,
   "end": 109.14,
   "text": "You have no authority here.",
   "start_frame": 2575,
   "end_frame": 2619
  },
  {
   "start": 109.64,
   "end": 111.48,
   "text": "Your orders mean nothing.",
   "start_frame": 2631,
   "end_frame": 2675
  },
  {
   "start": 112.34,
   "end": 115.23,
   "text": "This order does not come from me.",
   "start_frame": 2696,
   "end_frame": 2765
  },
  {
   "start": 115.28,
   "end": 115.86,
   "text": "It",
   "start_frame": 2766,
   "end_frame": 2780
  },
  {
   "start": 116.97,
   "end": 118.89,
   "text": "comes from the king. We",
   "start_frame": 2807,
   "end_frame": 2853
  },
  {
   "start": 119.74,
   "end": 121.56,
   "text": "signed it this morning.",
   "start_frame": 2873,
   "end_frame": 2917
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_02b": [
  {
   "start": 63.15,
   "end": 63.89,
   "text": "Are you",
   "start_frame": 1515,
   "end_frame": 1533
  },
  {
   "start": 92.26,
   "end": 94.07000000000001,
   "text": "saying there's another way into Mordor?",
   "start_frame": 2214,
   "end_frame": 2257
  },
  {
   "start": 94.12,
   "end": 94.74,
   "text": "Lead",
   "start_frame": 2258,
   "end_frame": 2273
  },
  {
   "start": 107.69,
   "end": 108.69,
   "text": "the way, Smeagol.",
   "start_frame": 2584,
   "end_frame": 2608
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_04": [
  {
   "start": 0.69,
   "end": 1.99,
   "text": "From",
   "start_frame": 16,
   "end_frame": 47
  },
  {
   "start": 6.23,
   "end": 11.97,
   "text": "the lowest dungeon to the highest peak,\nI fought in the battle of Morgoth.",
   "start_frame": 149,
   "end_frame": 287
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_04b": [
  {
   "start": 16.18,
   "end": 22.16,
   "text": "Until at last I threw down my enemy,\nand smote his ruin upon the mountains took",
   "start_frame": 388,
   "end_frame": 531
  },
  {
   "start": 30.4,
   "end": 31.48,
   "text": "me, and",
   "start_frame": 729,
   "end_frame": 755
  },
  {
   "start": 32.65,
   "end": 35.97,
   "text": "I strayed out of thought and time.",
   "start_frame": 783,
   "end_frame": 863
  },
  {
   "start": 36.03,
   "end": 36.69,
   "text": "The",
   "start_frame": 864,
   "end_frame": 880
  },
  {
   "start": 37.38,
   "end": 43.67,
   "text": "stars wheeled overhead, and every\nday was as long as a life-age",
   "start_frame": 897,
   "end_frame": 1048
  },
  {
   "start": 43.72,
   "end": 45.42,
   "text": "of the earth. It",
   "start_frame": 1049,
   "end_frame": 1090
  },
  {
   "start": 47.75,
   "end": 48.95,
   "text": "was not the end.",
   "start_frame": 1146,
   "end_frame": 1174
  },
  {
   "start": 49.56,
   "end": 52.4,
   "text": "I felt life in me again.",
   "start_frame": 1189,
   "end_frame": 1257
  },
  {
   "start": 54.14,
   "end": 58.42,
   "text": "I've been sent back until my task is done.",
   "start_frame": 1299,
   "end_frame": 1402
  },
  {
   "start": 62.55,
   "end": 65.55,
   "text": "I am Gandalf the White, and",
   "start_frame": 1501,
   "end_frame": 1573
  },
  {
   "start": 68.23,
   "end": 70.31,
   "text": "I come back to you now. The",
   "start_frame": 1637,
   "end_frame": 1687
  },
  {
   "start": 71.7,
   "end": 72.82,
   "text": "turn of time.",
   "start_frame": 1720,
   "end_frame": 1747
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_05b": [
  {
   "start": 4.53,
   "end": 8.16,
   "text": "So, this is the answer to all the riddles.",
   "start_frame": 108,
   "end_frame": 195
  },
  {
   "start": 10.82,
   "end": 12.94,
   "text": "Here in the wild I have you,",
   "start_frame": 259,
   "end_frame": 310
  },
  {
   "start": 14.06,
   "end": 18.38,
   "text": "two halflings, and a host of men at my call.",
   "start_frame": 337,
   "end_frame": 441
  },
  {
   "start": 18.44,
   "end": 19.2,
   "text": "Don't",
   "start_frame": 442,
   "end_frame": 460
  },
  {
   "start": 53.4,
   "end": 55.28,
   "text": "you understand? He's",
   "start_frame": 1281,
   "end_frame": 1326
  },
  {
   "start": 57.06,
   "end": 58.26,
   "text": "got to destroy it!",
   "start_frame": 1369,
   "end_frame": 1398
  },
  {
   "start": 62.24,
   "end": 63.04,
   "text": "Please,",
   "start_frame": 1493,
   "end_frame": 1512
  },
  {
   "start": 63.57,
   "end": 64.95,
   "text": "it's such a burden.",
   "start_frame": 1525,
   "end_frame": 1558
  },
  {
   "start": 66.68,
   "end": 68.32,
   "text": "Will you not help him?",
   "start_frame": 1600,
   "end_frame": 1639
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_06b": [
  {
   "start": 7.15,
   "end": 13.16,
   "text": "I cannot allow you before Théoden King\nso armed, Gandalf Graham, by order of",
   "start_frame": 171,
   "end_frame": 315
  },
  {
   "start": 13.21,
   "end": 15.49,
   "text": "Grima Wormtongue, your",
   "start_frame": 317,
   "end_frame": 371
  },
  {
   "start": 18.26,
   "end": 22.4,
   "text": "staff. You would not part an\nold man from his walking stick.",
   "start_frame": 438,
   "end_frame": 537
  },
  {
   "start": 35.6,
   "end": 42.4,
   "text": "The courtesy of your hall is somewhat\nlessened of late, Théoden King.",
   "start_frame": 854,
   "end_frame": 1017
  },
  {
   "start": 45.58,
   "end": 49.98,
   "text": "Why should I welcome you,",
   "start_frame": 1093,
   "end_frame": 1199
  },
  {
   "start": 51.3,
   "end": 57.84,
   "text": "Gandalf Stormcrow?\nA just question, my liege.",
   "start_frame": 1231,
   "end_frame": 1388
  },
  {
   "start": 62.58,
   "end": 68.22,
   "text": "I will draw you, Saruman,\nas poison is drawn from a wound.",
   "start_frame": 1501,
   "end_frame": 1637
  },
  {
   "start": 68.9,
   "end": 69.96,
   "text": "If",
   "start_frame": 1653,
   "end_frame": 1679
  },
  {
   "start": 74.62,
   "end": 75.5,
   "text": "I go,",
   "start_frame": 1790,
   "end_frame": 1812
  },
  {
   "start": 76.18,
   "end": 77.94,
   "text": "Théoden dies.",
   "start_frame": 1828,
   "end_frame": 1870
  },
  {
   "start": 78.68,
   "end": 80.57,
   "text": "You did not kill me.",
   "start_frame": 1888,
   "end_frame": 1933
  },
  {
   "start": 81.17,
   "end": 83.05,
   "text": "You will not kill him.",
   "start_frame": 1948,
   "end_frame": 1993
  },
  {
   "start": 87.26,
   "end": 88.32,
   "text": "Rohan.",
   "start_frame": 2094,
   "end_frame": 2119
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_08": [
  {
   "start": 6.77,
   "end": 7.49,
   "text": "Look,",
   "start_frame": 162,
   "end_frame": 179
  },
  {
   "start": 9.16,
   "end": 11.88,
   "text": "Osgiliath burns. Hurry!",
   "start_frame": 219,
   "end_frame": 285
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_09": [
  {
   "start": 1.23,
   "end": 3.53,
   "text": "Helm's Deep. There it is.",
   "start_frame": 29,
   "end_frame": 84
  },
  {
   "start": 7.98,
   "end": 10.32,
   "text": "We're safe. We're safe.",
   "start_frame": 191,
   "end_frame": 247
  },
  {
   "start": 11.34,
   "end": 12.549999999999999,
   "text": "We're safe. We're safe. We're safe.",
   "start_frame": 272,
   "end_frame": 301
  },
  {
   "start": 12.6,
   "end": 13.36,
   "text": "Come on, Aedir.",
   "start_frame": 302,
   "end_frame": 320
  },
  {
   "start": 14.26,
   "end": 15.42,
   "text": "Back here.",
   "start_frame": 342,
   "end_frame": 370
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_09b": [
  {
   "start": 9.46,
   "end": 13.91,
   "text": "Final count, forty-two. Forty-two?",
   "start_frame": 227,
   "end_frame": 333
  },
  {
   "start": 14.38,
   "end": 20.16,
   "text": "Oh, that's not bad for a\npointy-eared elvish princeling.",
   "start_frame": 345,
   "end_frame": 483
  },
  {
   "start": 20.8,
   "end": 24.48,
   "text": "I myself am sitting pretty on forty-three.",
   "start_frame": 499,
   "end_frame": 587
  },
  {
   "start": 29.05,
   "end": 32.41,
   "text": "Forty-three? He was already dead.",
   "start_frame": 697,
   "end_frame": 777
  },
  {
   "start": 33.22,
   "end": 35.550000000000004,
   "text": "He was twitching. He was twitching?",
   "start_frame": 797,
   "end_frame": 853
  },
  {
   "start": 35.6,
   "end": 39.330000000000005,
   "text": "Cause he's got my axe embedded\nin his nervous system!",
   "start_frame": 854,
   "end_frame": 943
  },
  {
   "start": 39.38,
   "end": 39.9,
   "text": "Now,",
   "start_frame": 945,
   "end_frame": 957
  },
  {
   "start": 41.3,
   "end": 47.22,
   "text": "family will yield mice that climb up\nsometimes and they tickle me awfully.",
   "start_frame": 991,
   "end_frame": 1133
  },
  {
   "start": 47.74,
   "end": 50.42,
   "text": "I'm always trying to get something with it.",
   "start_frame": 1145,
   "end_frame": 1210
  },
  {
   "start": 62.43,
   "end": 65.25,
   "text": "Many of these trees were my friends.",
   "start_frame": 1498,
   "end_frame": 1566
  },
  {
   "start": 66.07,
   "end": 70.81,
   "text": "Creatures I had known from nut and acorn.",
   "start_frame": 1585,
   "end_frame": 1699
  },
  {
   "start": 71.84,
   "end": 75.45,
   "text": "I'm sorry, Treebeard.\nThey had voices of their own.",
   "start_frame": 1724,
   "end_frame": 1810
  },
  {
   "start": 75.5,
   "end": 76.46,
   "text": "The",
   "start_frame": 1812,
   "end_frame": 1835
  },
  {
   "start": 81.38,
   "end": 83.29,
   "text": "wizards should know better.",
   "start_frame": 1953,
   "end_frame": 1998
  },
  {
   "start": 83.34,
   "end": 84.12,
   "text": "TURN!",
   "start_frame": 2000,
   "end_frame": 2018
  },
  {
   "start": 86.14,
   "end": 87.32,
   "text": "LOOOOO-",
   "start_frame": 2067,
   "end_frame": 2095
  },
  {
   "start": 102.12,
   "end": 106.32,
   "text": "Entitions of men for this stretch.",
   "start_frame": 2450,
   "end_frame": 2551
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignTTT_10b": [
  {
   "start": 9.21,
   "end": 10.11,
   "text": "Thunders!",
   "start_frame": 221,
   "end_frame": 242
  },
  {
   "start": 65.45,
   "end": 67.75,
   "text": "Retribution swift. The",
   "start_frame": 1570,
   "end_frame": 1626
  },
  {
   "start": 75.42,
   "end": 77.66,
   "text": "Helm's Deep is over. The",
   "start_frame": 1810,
   "end_frame": 1863
  },
  {
   "start": 78.6,
   "end": 81.52,
   "text": "battle for Middle-earth is about to begin.",
   "start_frame": 1886,
   "end_frame": 1956
  },
  {
   "start": 86.7,
   "end": 90.3,
   "text": "All our hopes now lie\nwith two little hobbits.",
   "start_frame": 2080,
   "end_frame": 2167
  },
  {
   "start": 91.42,
   "end": 93.1,
   "text": "Somewhere in the Wooden...",
   "start_frame": 2194,
   "end_frame": 2234
  },
  {
   "start": 96.42,
   "end": 99.74,
   "text": "Come on, hobbits! No ways to go yet.",
   "start_frame": 2314,
   "end_frame": 2393
  },
  {
   "start": 100.42,
   "end": 102.1,
   "text": "Sméagol will show you the way.",
   "start_frame": 2410,
   "end_frame": 2450
  },
  {
   "start": 102.38,
   "end": 103.7,
   "text": "Follow me.",
   "start_frame": 2457,
   "end_frame": 2488
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_01a": [
  {
   "start": 4.85,
   "end": 10.67,
   "text": "As Saruman's evil is washed away,\nwe send a clear message to Mordor.",
   "start_frame": 116,
   "end_frame": 256
  },
  {
   "start": 11.59,
   "end": 16.599999999999998,
   "text": "Men are not so weak yet that they are\npowerless to resist the Dark Lord's will",
   "start_frame": 278,
   "end_frame": 398
  },
  {
   "start": 16.65,
   "end": 18.49,
   "text": "entirely. The",
   "start_frame": 399,
   "end_frame": 443
  },
  {
   "start": 20.3,
   "end": 26.099999999999998,
   "text": "ruin of Isengard will prove to be a setback,\nbut we would be fools to believe it a",
   "start_frame": 487,
   "end_frame": 626
  },
  {
   "start": 26.15,
   "end": 26.97,
   "text": "deterrent.",
   "start_frame": 627,
   "end_frame": 647
  },
  {
   "start": 30.77,
   "end": 33.43,
   "text": "Sauron's power grows by the day.",
   "start_frame": 738,
   "end_frame": 802
  },
  {
   "start": 33.57,
   "end": 36.24,
   "text": "Soon he will be ready to strike.",
   "start_frame": 805,
   "end_frame": 869
  },
  {
   "start": 36.29,
   "end": 40.75,
   "text": "Our only advantage now lies in his hubris.",
   "start_frame": 870,
   "end_frame": 978
  },
  {
   "start": 41.57,
   "end": 47.09,
   "text": "We must force his hand and make him believe\nthat we will use the ring against him.",
   "start_frame": 997,
   "end_frame": 1130
  },
  {
   "start": 55.62,
   "end": 60.76,
   "text": "Tonight, we remember those who gave\ntheir blood to defend this country.",
   "start_frame": 1334,
   "end_frame": 1458
  },
  {
   "start": 62.15,
   "end": 65.06,
   "text": "Hail the victorious dead! Hail!",
   "start_frame": 1491,
   "end_frame": 1561
  },
  {
   "start": 79.18,
   "end": 80.94,
   "text": "No news of Frodo.",
   "start_frame": 1900,
   "end_frame": 1942
  },
  {
   "start": 81.75,
   "end": 85.07,
   "text": "No word. Nothing. What",
   "start_frame": 1962,
   "end_frame": 2041
  },
  {
   "start": 88.29,
   "end": 90.11,
   "text": "does your heart tell you? What",
   "start_frame": 2118,
   "end_frame": 2162
  },
  {
   "start": 122.51,
   "end": 123.21,
   "text": "you do.",
   "start_frame": 2940,
   "end_frame": 2957
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_01b": [
  {
   "start": 4.08,
   "end": 5.38,
   "text": "Gandalf! What",
   "start_frame": 97,
   "end_frame": 129
  },
  {
   "start": 41.34,
   "end": 43.42,
   "text": "did you see? Court",
   "start_frame": 992,
   "end_frame": 1042
  },
  {
   "start": 51.98,
   "end": 52.88,
   "text": "Yard of Stone.",
   "start_frame": 1247,
   "end_frame": 1269
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_02a": [
  {
   "start": 0.18,
   "end": 2.2,
   "text": "A fool, but",
   "start_frame": 4,
   "end_frame": 52
  },
  {
   "start": 3.11,
   "end": 4.61,
   "text": "an honest fool, he remains.",
   "start_frame": 74,
   "end_frame": 110
  },
  {
   "start": 5.72,
   "end": 7.72,
   "text": "We've been strangely fortunate.",
   "start_frame": 137,
   "end_frame": 185
  },
  {
   "start": 8.33,
   "end": 11.95,
   "text": "Pippin saw in the Palantir a\nglimpse of the enemy's plan.",
   "start_frame": 199,
   "end_frame": 286
  },
  {
   "start": 13.28,
   "end": 16.87,
   "text": "Sauron moves to strike\nthe city of Minas Tirith.",
   "start_frame": 318,
   "end_frame": 404
  },
  {
   "start": 16.92,
   "end": 20.46,
   "text": "I will go. No. They must be warned.",
   "start_frame": 406,
   "end_frame": 491
  },
  {
   "start": 20.52,
   "end": 21.78,
   "text": "They will be.",
   "start_frame": 492,
   "end_frame": 522
  },
  {
   "start": 28.61,
   "end": 30.55,
   "text": "Follow the river, but",
   "start_frame": 686,
   "end_frame": 733
  },
  {
   "start": 31.05,
   "end": 32.29,
   "text": "to the black ships.",
   "start_frame": 745,
   "end_frame": 774
  },
  {
   "start": 34.28,
   "end": 35.58,
   "text": "Understand this.",
   "start_frame": 822,
   "end_frame": 853
  },
  {
   "start": 36.11,
   "end": 39.47,
   "text": "Things are now in motion\nthat cannot be undone.",
   "start_frame": 866,
   "end_frame": 947
  },
  {
   "start": 41.63,
   "end": 44.49,
   "text": "I ride for Minas Tirith. And",
   "start_frame": 999,
   "end_frame": 1067
  },
  {
   "start": 46.24,
   "end": 47.76,
   "text": "I won't be going alone.",
   "start_frame": 1109,
   "end_frame": 1146
  },
  {
   "start": 51.08,
   "end": 55.2,
   "text": "How far is Minas Tirith? Three\ndays ride, as the Nazgul flies.",
   "start_frame": 1225,
   "end_frame": 1324
  },
  {
   "start": 55.38,
   "end": 57.82,
   "text": "And you better hope we don't\nhave one of those on our tail.",
   "start_frame": 1329,
   "end_frame": 1387
  },
  {
   "start": 61.11,
   "end": 62.47,
   "text": "Something for the road.",
   "start_frame": 1466,
   "end_frame": 1499
  },
  {
   "start": 64.35,
   "end": 65.83,
   "text": "Last of the Longbottom Leaf.",
   "start_frame": 1544,
   "end_frame": 1579
  },
  {
   "start": 66.05,
   "end": 70.0,
   "text": "I know you've run out.\nYou smoke too much, but...",
   "start_frame": 1585,
   "end_frame": 1680
  },
  {
   "start": 71.27,
   "end": 72.41,
   "text": "We'll see each other soon.",
   "start_frame": 1710,
   "end_frame": 1737
  },
  {
   "start": 80.89,
   "end": 82.17,
   "text": "Don't know what's going on.",
   "start_frame": 1941,
   "end_frame": 1972
  },
  {
   "start": 82.9,
   "end": 86.35000000000001,
   "text": "Merry. Run, Shadowfax.\nShow us the meaning of haste.",
   "start_frame": 1989,
   "end_frame": 2072
  },
  {
   "start": 86.4,
   "end": 87.12,
   "text": "Merry!",
   "start_frame": 2073,
   "end_frame": 2090
  },
  {
   "start": 88.24,
   "end": 88.98,
   "text": "Cast",
   "start_frame": 2117,
   "end_frame": 2135
  },
  {
   "start": 105.86,
   "end": 108.56,
   "text": "into the realm of Gondor! Be",
   "start_frame": 2540,
   "end_frame": 2605
  },
  {
   "start": 120.32,
   "end": 121.64,
   "text": "nested in",
   "start_frame": 2887,
   "end_frame": 2919
  },
  {
   "start": 123.01,
   "end": 124.21,
   "text": "the City of King.",
   "start_frame": 2952,
   "end_frame": 2981
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_02b": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_03a": [
  {
   "start": 50.74,
   "end": 52.64,
   "text": "Six thousand spears. Six",
   "start_frame": 1217,
   "end_frame": 1263
  },
  {
   "start": 56.27,
   "end": 59.27,
   "text": "thousand will not be enough\nto break the lines of Mordor.",
   "start_frame": 1350,
   "end_frame": 1422
  },
  {
   "start": 62.0,
   "end": 63.14,
   "text": "More will come.",
   "start_frame": 1488,
   "end_frame": 1515
  },
  {
   "start": 63.94,
   "end": 66.5,
   "text": "Every hour lost hastens Gondor's defeat.",
   "start_frame": 1534,
   "end_frame": 1596
  },
  {
   "start": 66.96,
   "end": 69.84,
   "text": "We have to do it. Then we must try it.",
   "start_frame": 1607,
   "end_frame": 1676
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_03b": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_05a": [
  {
   "start": 63.86,
   "end": 65.5,
   "text": "Khan's army, come. With",
   "start_frame": 1532,
   "end_frame": 1572
  },
  {
   "start": 66.44,
   "end": 67.06,
   "text": "Vendir.",
   "start_frame": 1594,
   "end_frame": 1609
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_05b": [
  {
   "start": 0.27,
   "end": 1.37,
   "text": "Thanks for watching!",
   "start_frame": 6,
   "end_frame": 32
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_06a": [
  {
   "start": 29.68,
   "end": 31.36,
   "text": "The only way is to not",
   "start_frame": 712,
   "end_frame": 752
  },
  {
   "start": 41.81,
   "end": 42.71,
   "text": "go back.",
   "start_frame": 1003,
   "end_frame": 1025
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_06b": [
  {
   "start": 13.68,
   "end": 15.24,
   "text": "We did it, Mr. Frodo. We",
   "start_frame": 328,
   "end_frame": 365
  },
  {
   "start": 23.13,
   "end": 25.07,
   "text": "get through and see. To",
   "start_frame": 555,
   "end_frame": 601
  },
  {
   "start": 51.68,
   "end": 52.96,
   "text": "make it down the hill, for starters.",
   "start_frame": 1240,
   "end_frame": 1271
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_07a": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_07b": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_08a": [
  {
   "start": 3.02,
   "end": 4.02,
   "text": "Thanks for watching!",
   "start_frame": 72,
   "end_frame": 96
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_11a": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_11b": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_12a": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_12b": [],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_13b": [
  {
   "start": 0.88,
   "end": 1.64,
   "text": "Thank you.",
   "start_frame": 21,
   "end_frame": 39
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_14a": [
  {
   "start": 1.21,
   "end": 1.99,
   "text": "Mr.",
   "start_frame": 29,
   "end_frame": 47
  },
  {
   "start": 18.34,
   "end": 18.92,
   "text": "Frodo?",
   "start_frame": 440,
   "end_frame": 454
  },
  {
   "start": 23.0,
   "end": 24.9,
   "text": "What is it? It's",
   "start_frame": 552,
   "end_frame": 597
  },
  {
   "start": 26.68,
   "end": 29.12,
   "text": "been four years to the day\nsince we're at the top, Sam.",
   "start_frame": 640,
   "end_frame": 698
  },
  {
   "start": 30.86,
   "end": 33.12,
   "text": "It's never really healed. There",
   "start_frame": 740,
   "end_frame": 794
  },
  {
   "start": 38.01,
   "end": 41.86,
   "text": "I'm back again. A Hobbit's\nTale by Bilbo Baggins.",
   "start_frame": 912,
   "end_frame": 1004
  },
  {
   "start": 41.91,
   "end": 42.69,
   "text": "Lord",
   "start_frame": 1005,
   "end_frame": 1024
  },
  {
   "start": 44.31,
   "end": 46.88,
   "text": "of the Rings by Frodo Baggins.",
   "start_frame": 1063,
   "end_frame": 1125
  },
  {
   "start": 46.93,
   "end": 47.71,
   "text": "Quiet.",
   "start_frame": 1126,
   "end_frame": 1145
  },
  {
   "start": 55.14,
   "end": 56.7,
   "text": "There's room for a little more.",
   "start_frame": 1323,
   "end_frame": 1360
  }
 ],
 "AOTRCampaignROTK_14b": [
  {
   "start": 11.79,
   "end": 16.76,
   "text": "I think I'm quite ready\nfor another adventure.",
   "start_frame": 282,
   "end_frame": 402
  },
  {
   "start": 17.22,
   "end": 17.94,
   "text": "Here",
   "start_frame": 413,
   "end_frame": 430
  },
  {
   "start": 63.02,
   "end": 67.3,
   "text": "at last, on the shores of the sea, comes",
   "start_frame": 1512,
   "end_frame": 1615
  },
  {
   "start": 68.5,
   "end": 70.14,
   "text": "the end of our fellowship.",
   "start_frame": 1644,
   "end_frame": 1683
  },
  {
   "start": 75.01,
   "end": 77.01,
   "text": "Do not say, do not weep,",
   "start_frame": 1800,
   "end_frame": 1848
  },
  {
   "start": 77.74,
   "end": 80.44,
   "text": "do not all tears. It",
   "start_frame": 1865,
   "end_frame": 1930
  },
  {
   "start": 99.56,
   "end": 101.76,
   "text": "is time, Frodo. We",
   "start_frame": 2389,
   "end_frame": 2442
  },
  {
   "start": 111.57,
   "end": 114.81,
   "text": "set out to save the Shire, Sam, and",
   "start_frame": 2677,
   "end_frame": 2755
  },
  {
   "start": 116.08,
   "end": 118.2,
   "text": "it has been saved. Not",
   "start_frame": 2785,
   "end_frame": 2836
  },
  {
   "start": 122.6,
   "end": 123.46,
   "text": "for me.",
   "start_frame": 2942,
   "end_frame": 2963
  },
  {
   "start": 125.44,
   "end": 127.06,
   "text": "You don't mean that.",
   "start_frame": 3010,
   "end_frame": 3049
  },
  {
   "start": 129.16,
   "end": 131.7,
   "text": "You can't leave. The",
   "start_frame": 3099,
   "end_frame": 3160
  },
  {
   "start": 140.01,
   "end": 142.25,
   "text": "last pages are for you, Sam.",
   "start_frame": 3360,
   "end_frame": 3414
  }
 ]
}